    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated directly across the road from Portiuncula, this two-bedroom, two-storey house offers a convenient location in Ballinasloe. Dating from the 1950s, it is within walking distance of the town centre, as well as nearby primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes a spacious sitting room with an open fireplace, providing a comfortable space to relax. The cosy kitchen/dining room has a solid fuel range used for cooking/heating. There is also electric some heating in the house. The bedrooms comprise one double and one single room, along with a bathroom. Double-glazed windows and PVC doors are practical features of the property.\r\n\r\nTo the front is a small flower garden, while a driveway to the side provides off-street parking. The house is in good condition overall, though it would benefit from some updating to suit a new owner’s taste.\r\n\r\nWith its manageable size and location close to the hospital, schools and town centre, this property offers an appealing opportunity for buyers seeking a home in Ballinasloe."
      },
